"   ipa-getkeytab -s ipa.example.com -p HTTP/web.example.com -k /etc/httpd/"
"httpd.keytab\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" Générer et récupérer un tableau de clés d'un service IPA :\n"
"   ipa-getkeytab -s ipa.example.com -p HTTP/web.example.com -k /etc/httpd/"
"httpd.keytab\n"
"\n"

