" Allow user to create a keytab:\n"
"   ipa host-allow-create-keytab test2 --users=tuser1\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" Autoriser un utilisateur à créer un tableau de clé :\n"
"   ipa host-allow-create-keytab test2 --users=tuser1\n"

